[[Maintenance therapy in classical follicular lymphoma]]

!! Design

The follicular lymphoma (FL) cohort received bendamustine–rituximab (BR) and 2 years of rituximab maintenance before randomization to stop or continue for another 2 years.

!! Practical interpretation

This addresses maintenance duration (4 versus 2 years), not whether to begin maintenance after BR. A historical no-maintenance comparison is not equivalent to randomized evidence. [[MAINTAIN FL report, 2017|https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0006497119810005]]

Evidence reviewed September 7, 2026.
